loop or on the <abb>APU</abb> leak detection loop, and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00016004.0001001.011"><requirement lid="N.00016004.0001001.012" req-id="R07629"><para code="00016004.0001001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00016004.0001001.013">If the <abb>CFDS</abb> reports a fault
